{
 "brief": "The al-Qassam Brigades, the military wing of Hamas, released video footage of slain commander Nael Sameer Al-Najjar, according to Shehab Wire. Al-Najjar held a leadership position within the weapons and combat support battalion of the Khan Younis Brigade, one of the organization's primary operational units in southern Gaza.\n\nThe release formed part of a series the brigades titled \"Storm's Satellites,\" a program documenting fallen fighters and commanders. The footage was distributed as part of the group's ongoing documentation of casualties sustained during the conflict.",
